            "review_text": "Sienna\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nAmazing\nJul 2020\nThis meal right here makes my heart (and stomach) so happy. I have been coming to Kiki Hot Pot since 2019, at least once a month, sometimes more and they never disappoint. I was scared they would be one of the restaurants that close permanently because of COVID - but they reopened again. If you've never gone, RUN! Ask for their spicy sacha sauce and prepare for your taste buds to explode.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 31, 2020",
